    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "If my harebrained plan at the Agency doesn’t work, this may be the last time I ever see them. I stuff those big feelings",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 607
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lucy.” Liam blinks at me in surprise. “Everything okay?” He’s right to be surprised and concerned",
          "ok": true,
